---
title: Itqan class diagram 1 — Accounts and Quran content
config:
  theme: neutral
---
classDiagram
direction LR

class Account {
  +UUID accountId
  +String identitySubject
  +String accountType
  +String displayName
  +String email
  +String language
  +DateTime createdAt
}
class TeacherDetail {
  +UUID teacherId
  +String schoolName
}
class ConsentRecord {
  +UUID consentId
  +UUID readerId
  +String purpose
  +DateTime grantedAt
  +DateTime withdrawnAt?
  +withdraw(date)
}
class Surah {
  +int surahNumber
  +String arabicName
  +String englishName
  +int verseCount
}
class Verse {
  +int surahNumber
  +int verseNumber
  +String uthmaniText
  +String imlaeiText
}
class Word {
  +int surahNumber
  +int verseNumber
  +int wordPosition
  +String wordText
  +int audioStartMs
  +int audioEndMs
}
class DeletionLog {
  +UUID logId
  +String accountType
  +DateTime deletedAt
}
class AccountService {
  +registerAccount(type, name, email, schoolName)
  +updateProfile(accountId, name, language, schoolName)
  +grantConsent(readerId, purpose)
  +withdrawConsent(readerId, purpose)
  +getStoredDataSummary(accountId)
  +deleteAccount(accountId)
}
class IdentityProvider {
  <<external>>
  +createCredentials()
  +authenticate()
  +logout()
  +removeAccount()
}

Account "1" -- "0..1" TeacherDetail : teacher only
Account "1" -- "0..*" ConsentRecord : Reader grants
Surah "1" -- "1..*" Verse : contains
Verse "1" -- "1..*" Word : contains
AccountService ..> Account : manages
AccountService ..> ConsentRecord : records
AccountService ..> DeletionLog : writes anonymous entry
AccountService ..> IdentityProvider : credentials and deletion
